      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Filters/FinanceAuthorizationFilter.cs (add WorkAssignmentEntitySet beside :226-234; extend only if the internal filter is reused)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/shared/Spaarke.Core/Auth/OperationAccessPolicy.cs (only if a new operation key is needed — see constraints)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Finance/FinanceEndpoints.cs:30-33 (group /api/finance, RequireAuthorization, AddFinanceAuthorizationFilter)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/ExternalAccess/ExternalProjectDataEndpoints.cs:1268 (UploadDocumentForParent — copy its order: gate, container, upload, row, owner, compensation) and :255</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/ExternalAccess/AccessibleRecordSetService.cs:117 (IsOperationPermittedAsync — required for mutating routes, see :96)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Infrastructure/Dataverse/RecordContainerResolver.cs (ResolveForRecordAsync — secure container or fail closed)</file>
